1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
보드를 본체 안에 넣기
Seat the module in the body

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,800
보드 받침틀 넣기
Fit the board support frame

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,800
나사 링을 나사산에 맞추기
Start the retaining ring by hand

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,800
3점 조임 툴 끼우기
Engage the three point tool

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,400
링을 돌려 보드 고정
Tighten the board retaining ring

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,600
조임 툴 빼기
Remove the tightening tool

7
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,800
받침판 아래쪽에 자석 붙이기
Bond the magnet under the tray

8
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,200
큰 구멍으로 기둥 머리 통과
Pass the post heads through the holes

9
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,400
안쪽 받침판 잠그기
Lock the inner battery tray

10
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,800
배터리를 가이드 안에 넣기
Place the battery inside the guide

11
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:37,100
배터리 연결과 전선 정리
Connect the battery and route the leads

12
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,500
뚜껑 전체를 본체에 넣기
Insert the complete lid

13
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,700
뚜껑 전체를 돌려 잠그기
Rotate the complete lid to lock

14
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,900
V18 조립 완료
V18 assembly complete
